@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Agent
actor "Claims Adjuster" as Adjuster
actor Admin
actor Customer
participant "Angular App" as UI
participant "Ocelot Gateway" as GW
participant "ClaimsService" as CS
participant "PolicyBillingService" as PB
participant "ClaimsDb" as DB

Agent -> UI : Start FNOL
UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/fnols
GW -> CS : Create FNOL draft
CS -> PB : Resolve Date-of-Loss policy coverage
PB --> CS : Historical policy + coverage contract
CS --> GW : FNOL draft
GW --> UI : FNOL draft

Agent -> UI : Complete FNOL + create Draft Claim
UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/claims/from-fnol/{fnolId}
GW -> CS : Create formal claim draft
CS --> GW : Claim draft
GW --> UI : Claim draft
Agent -> UI : Upload evidence + submit Claim
UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/claims/{claimId}/submit
GW -> CS : Validate evidence + claim cap + freeze submission
CS -> DB : Atomic submit + consume claim slot
DB --> CS : Submitted Claim
CS --> GW : Submitted
GW --> UI : Submitted

Admin -> UI : Assign Adjuster
UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/admin/claims/{claimId}/assign
GW -> CS : Permanent assign-once Adjuster
CS -> DB : Save assignment
DB --> CS : Assigned
CS --> GW : Assigned
GW --> UI : Assigned

Adjuster -> UI : Open review
UI -> GW : GET /claims/api/adjuster/claims/{claimId}/review
GW -> CS : Open review
CS --> GW : Claim + evidence + coverage context
GW --> UI : Review workspace
Adjuster -> UI : Record notes + assessment + decision
UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/adjuster/claims/{claimId}/decision
GW -> CS : Persist decision
CS -> PB : Coverage/limit/deductible contract
PB --> CS : Historical terms
CS -> DB : Save decision + settlement
DB --> CS : Settlement result

alt Settlement <= Adjuster authority
  CS --> GW : Settlement pending customer acceptance
  GW --> UI : Settlement
else Settlement > Adjuster authority
  CS --> GW : Pending admin authority
  GW --> UI : Escalation status
  Admin -> UI : Approve/reject exact settlement amount
  UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/admin/claims/{claimId}/settlement/{action}
  GW -> CS : Apply authority decision
  CS -> DB : Save authority decision
end

Customer -> UI : Accept settlement
UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/customer/claims/{claimId}/settlement/accept
GW -> CS : Accept settlement
CS --> GW : Accepted
GW --> UI : Payout selection
Customer -> UI : Select Bank Transfer / UPI
UI -> GW : POST /claims/api/customer/claims/{claimId}/payout
GW -> CS : Simulate payout
CS -> DB : Persist payout status
DB --> CS : Paid / Failed
CS --> GW : Payout result
GW --> UI : Result
@enduml
